At least 3 years’ experience in project management or a related role in renewable energy or infrastructure field would be advantageous;
Experience in dealing with external stakeholders in a professional environment;
Experience in dealing with international players is a valuable plus;
Advanced user of MS Project and other Project Management tools;
Experience in interacting with external stakeholders;
Availability to travel throughout South Africa and internationally from time to time;
