Strong ability to plan work schedule and organize short, mid and long-term priorities;
Team player, ability to ensure support and collaboration both internally and externally;
Good presentation and communication skills;
Strong analytical skills and outcome-focused approach;
Problem solving, proactive mindset and positive “can do” attitude;
